{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":218532,\"title\":\"Call My Agent: Italy\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Welcome behind the scenes of Italian show business from the point of view of those in charge of managing the careers - and lives - of the stars: the agents. Lea, Gabriele, Vittorio and Elvira are the soul of CMA and they give their souls to it, ready for anything to make their stars shine. Managers, friends, confidants and psychologists: a good agent is all that and more. And they, each with their own style, are the best. Between hectic days and mundane nights, it's their personal lives that lose out -- but deep down they have too much fun to notice. With the departure of founder Claudio Maiorana, however, things will get a little more complicated.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dH4UW5bYjC1vKdOmbTxUgD31Xew.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uJpO7AOYJKLC2HJEKdvxDpb2P6m.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":7.4,\"voteCount\":34,\"year\":2023,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"status\":\"Returning Series\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":3,\"totalEpisodes\":18,\"createdBy\":[\"Lisa Nur Sultan\"],\"networks\":[\"Sky Atlantic \",\"Sky Serie\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"IT\",\"name\":\"Italy\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2025-11-28\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1728833,\"name\":\"Luca Ribuoli\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ZvfJlvAdBjH9NxF7SqL0o6OBvn.jpg\"},{\"id\":128222,\"name\":\"Michele Di Mauro\",\"character\":\"Vittorio Baronciani\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1709506,\"name\":\"Marzia Ubaldi\",\"character\":\"Elvira Bo\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nrKCpgduwNirLoPnj9RVU7jC6q3.jpg\"},{\"id\":2189836,\"name\":\"Maurizio Lastrico\",\"character\":\"Gabriele Di Lillo\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6aulhCiLAo440asTSWQm7oHsc40.jpg\"},{\"id\":1689522,\"name\":\"Emanuela Fanelli\",\"character\":\"Luana Pericoli\",\"photo\":\"https://im